              "type": "text",
              "text": "<h2>Important Information</h2><p><br></p><p>The course is presented in <strong><strong>five 2-hour sessions</strong></strong> and will take place in the Events Room on the first floor of North Kensington Library.</p><p><strong><strong>You can sign up for the whole course only. Please book only if you can attend all five sessions.</strong></strong></p><p><br></p><h3>Dates:</h3><p><strong><strong>Monday 12 October, 5.30pm–7.30pm</strong></strong><br><strong><strong>Monday 19 October, 5.30pm–7.30pm</strong></strong><br><strong><strong>Monday 26 October, 5.30pm–7.30pm</strong></strong><br><strong><strong>Monday 2 November, 5.30pm–7.30pm</strong></strong><br><strong><strong>Monday 9 November, 5.30pm–7.30pm</strong></strong></p><p><br></p><p>Places on this course are funded by the <strong><strong>Greater London Authority (GLA)</strong></strong>. There are only <strong><strong>10 free places</strong></strong>, so we recommend booking early, but please check that you are eligible before booking.</p><p><strong><strong>Please note: your place is not confirmed until you have completed the enrolment form, which the tutor will send to you after you book.</strong></strong></p><p><br></p><h3>Eligibility</h3><ul><li>You must be a <strong><strong>London resident aged 19+</strong></strong>. Priority will be given to RBKC residents.</li><li>You can attend <strong><strong>one free GLA-funded course per academic year</strong></strong>.</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>Booking fee</h3><p>There is a <strong><strong>£3 administrative booking fee</strong></strong>, which is refundable on request, minus the Eventbrite fee.</p><p>Please email <strong><strong>libraries@rbkc.gov.uk</strong></strong> if you have any questions about booking or would like to book without paying the booking fee.</p><p><br></p><h2>MORE INFORMATION:</h2>",
