              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p><strong><strong>Anna Orenstein-Cardona</strong></strong> grew up in Puerto Rico in a loving, multicultural home where money was often tight. From humble beginnings, she earned a degree in Brain and Cognitive Sciences from MIT and spent more than two decades on the trading floors of Wall Street and the City of London, working closely with some of the world’s largest institutional investors.</p><p>Anna is now a <strong><strong>Certified Financial Education Instructor (CFEI)</strong></strong>, author and founder of <strong><strong>Wear Your Money Crown®</strong></strong>, a holistic financial education and coaching firm.</p><p>Through her work with individuals, students and organisations, she combines real-world financial expertise with behavioural science and a compassionate approach to make money easier to understand and manage.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong><strong>TESTIMONIALS:</strong></strong></h3>",
