              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p>“Anna breaks financial jargon down into bite-sized pieces. She makes it easy to learn and is so down to earth and approachable. Any question is answered in a calm and kind way.”<br>— <strong><strong>Lorraine Field, Artist and Creator</strong></strong></p><p>“I feel excited rather than daunted by my financial picture. I have less of the ‘ignore and avoid’ attitude than I did before!”<br>— <strong><strong>G. Aarons, Financial Education and Coaching Client</strong></strong></p><p>“I was nervous about my finances, but I am now excited to apply the knowledge you’ve shared in my everyday life!”<br>— <strong><strong>H. Murrell, University Student</strong></strong></p><p>“I learned not only about my finances and budgets, but more importantly about myself and how I approach money. Financial knowledge gave me the confidence to take a much more hands-on approach to my finances and to do it at my own pace.”<br>— <strong><strong>Marisela Morales, Engineer and Mother</strong></strong></p><p>“I learned so much more than I expected from Anna. It is empowering to take charge of my finances, understand where I am now and what I can do to create a more secure future. I now have a growing emergency fund, a separate savings account and have contributed more to my pension. Thank you, Anna, for your teaching and encouragement!”<br>— <strong><strong>Colleen Jones, Financial Education and Coaching Client</strong></strong></p><p>“Anna has helped spur a financial and emotional transformation for me, my partner and my family. I am so grateful to have such a brilliant, empathetic and experienced mentor in my life.”<br>— <strong><strong>Dylan Weinberger, Financial Education and Coaching Client</strong></strong></p>",
